	(descr "Kyohritsu ADC1804_F (PCM1804) 56x33mm measured FP. Origin=board center. Pitch 2.54. Header drill 1.0 / pad 1.8 for 0.6sq pins. M3 holes NPTH 3.2 (module hole φ3, edge-to-outer 2.2). CN1F(L bottom)=pads1-3, CN2F(R top)=4-6, CN3/4 2x5=7,8,9,10,14, CN6F RST=11+14, CN7/8 pwr 2x3=12,13,14. Mother: solder female 2.54 sockets into pads (recommended) or solder module male pins. OVFL/OVFR (CN5F) omitted (NC). JP1F on module only.")
